<h1>Display Intensity</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="Description"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span></b> <span class="Command">Display Intensity</span> <span lang="EN-GB">displays the Intensity view for ModelMakerD sensor. This command is accessible from</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>View &gt; Display</b></i></span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Intensity</b></i></span></i> <span lang="EN-GB">and is only available when ModelMakerD sensor is detected by KUBE.</span></p>
